<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>To
Be Held on April 9, 2025</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">To
the Stockholders of NAYA Biosciences, Inc.:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
2024 Annual Meeting of Stockholders (the &#8220;Annual Meeting&#8221;) of NAYA Biosciences, Inc., a Nevada corporation (the &#8220;Company,&#8221;
&#8220;NAYA,&#8221; &#8220;we,&#8221; &#8220;us,&#8221; or &#8220;our&#8221;), will be held virtually on April 9, 2025 at 12:00 p.m.
Eastern Time. The Annual Meeting will be held virtually at <span style="text-decoration: underline">www.virtualshareholdermeeting.com/NAYA2024</span>. At the Annual Meeting,
the holders of our outstanding common stock will act on the following matters:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

